1
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:40,560
Comrade Yun Huhu,

2
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:42,320
you need to change your mindset.

3
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:43,580
If you can't beat them,

4
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:44,680
join them.

5
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:48,600
Master, I get it now.

6
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,620
Turn your opponents into teammates.

7
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:06,520
Oh my god,

8
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:07,920
how can there be a man

9
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:10,560
with such a perfect trinity
of traits in this world?

10
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:12,720
Not only is he handsome and good at math,

11
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:14,250
but he also has a great body.

12
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,080
It's just a pity

13
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:18,360
that Senior Shen recently
lost the gold medal.

14
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:20,240
I've heard it was a huge blow to him.

15
00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:22,360
No wonder we haven't seen him
at school lately.

16
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:24,360
I wonder if he'll turn

17
00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:28,360
from an ascetic hunk
into a melancholy puppy.

18
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:31,330
Why hasn't he accepted
my friend request yet?

19
00:01:32,440 --> 00:01:33,120
Qingqing,

20
00:01:34,160 --> 00:01:35,039
I'm

21
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:36,920
talking to you.

22
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:40,450
I'm only interested in 2847 right now.

23
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:42,280
I've sent him

24
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:43,360
over a hundred friend requests
in the past two days,

25
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:44,680
and he hasn't replied to a single one.

26
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:46,280
What does he mean by this?

27
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,240
Babe,

28
00:01:48,039 --> 00:01:50,240
are you really picking a fight with him?

29
00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:53,000
Maybe he just didn't see it.

30
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:53,800
Impossible.

31
00:01:54,039 --> 00:01:56,200
He grinds ranked matches all day long.

32
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:57,400
He's online

33
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,930
for over 15 hours every day.

34
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:01,200
And every time I match with him

35
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:02,080
and use all-chat,

36
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:03,360
he acts like he doesn't see it.

37
00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:04,920
Isn't he just ignoring me on purpose?

38
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:05,880
This 2847

39
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:07,240
is probably just a pretentious jerk.

40
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:08,720
Let's find another carry.

41
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:09,560
No.

42
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:12,840
I won't be satisfied
until I give him a piece of my mind.

43
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,120
I sent you so many friend requests,

44
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:16,560
and you just ignored them.

45
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:17,280
Don't you have basic manners?

46
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:17,960
Do you really think you're that good?

47
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:18,520
To me, you're just average.

48
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,440
Your stats are so unreal.
You must be hacking.

49
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:20,320
Just you wait.

50
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:23,280
I'm reporting you right now.

51
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:28,300
Time to eat.

52
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:35,400
2847 has accepted your friend request.

53
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:45,520
2847, I was possessed just now.

54
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:46,960
Please don't mind it.

55
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,960
You're so pro, I love it.

56
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,680
I'm a noob, please carry me.

57
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:52,880
Since you added me, you must like me.

58
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:54,320
The quarterly tournament is coming up.

59
00:02:54,320 --> 00:02:55,680
Wanna team up?

60
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,440
I can play any role.

61
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,400
Stop, stop, stop.

62
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,330
Whoever you are,

63
00:03:00,640 --> 00:03:02,520
get out of our Qingqing's body right now.

64
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:04,320
Fall back, fall back, fall back!

65
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:05,760
2847,

66
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:07,120
if you don't mind,

67
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:08,800
let's add each other on WeChat.

68
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,760
I'll definitely show you

69
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:12,420
what the best teammate
in the galaxy looks like.

70
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:17,200
Friend 2847 sent a game invitation.

71
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:23,160
Qingqing, you're not eating your noodles?

72
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:24,600
The Wi-Fi in the cafeteria sucks.

73
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:25,720
This 2847

74
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,320
is teaming up with me.

75
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:30,280
What a waste.

76
00:03:41,480 --> 00:03:43,480
My connection was lagging just now.

77
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:45,120
Wait till I respawn and watch me play.

78
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:46,600
It's okay. I'll carry you.

79
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:54,120
You're so awesome, bro.

80
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:56,040
Your skills

81
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:59,360
speak for themselves.

82
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:07,160
Bro,

83
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:09,920
isn't it a bit boring
with just the two of us?

84
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:11,960
Can I invite my friends to join us?

85
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:19,560
We're in business.

86
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,040
Sis,

87
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,960
I have a secret weapon today.

88
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:24,080
We definitely won't lose.

89
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:24,880
That's right,

90
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:27,280
the number one player on the server.

91
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:29,240
But don't worry about

92
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,600
how I got him to carry us.

93
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:31,760
Anyway,

94
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:34,080
I'll carry you tonight at a discount.

95
00:04:34,080 --> 00:04:35,280
But if he asks,

96
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,720
you have to say you're my friends,

97
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:37,440
got it?

98
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,140
Let's play.

99
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:40,880
Let's play. Coming.

100
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:43,480
We have three new friends
joining us today.

101
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:47,930
Your clients again.

102
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,250
Thanks for carrying me.

103
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:15,520
I got my highest rank ever

104
00:05:15,520 --> 00:05:17,440
in this season's placements.

105
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:19,600
So I want to gift you a skin.

106
00:05:19,840 --> 00:05:20,700
Take your pick.

107
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:23,760
No need. It's getting boring.

108
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:25,020
I'm quitting the game.

109
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:26,520
Why?

110
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:28,280
You're the number one player
on the server.

111
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:30,720
So many people practice day and night...

112
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:32,250
They can only eat your dust.

113
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:33,720
I can't live without you.

114
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,280
Losing you

115
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:36,210
is like the West losing Jerusalem.

116
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:38,040
I'm not as good as you say.

117
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:40,600
Actually, many games
are all about numbers.

118
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:42,760
Calculating damage, gear,

119
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:44,560
health bars, and probabilities

120
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:46,400
is just like doing math.

121
00:05:47,960 --> 00:05:51,560
Then your math must be really good.

122
00:05:53,760 --> 00:05:54,680
Not really.

123
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:57,100
You're just humblebragging.

124
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:01,960
I entered a competition

125
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:03,460
and failed miserably.

126
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:07,840
I used to think math was a towering peak.

127
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:10,200
If you climb day and night,

128
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:11,440
you can reach the top.

129
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:14,240
But once you reach that peak,

130
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,240
you'll realize

131
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:18,400
there are countless
higher mountains out there.

132
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:20,320
And the peak beneath your feet

133
00:06:20,440 --> 00:06:22,000
is nothing but an anthill.

134
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:25,120
Math is a game for geniuses.

135
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:29,010
Ordinary people can never catch up,
no matter how hard they try.

136
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,680
Am I really losing the carry

137
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:36,980
I finally managed to find?

138
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,600
When it comes to math,

139
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:44,480
knowing just enough is perfectly fine.

140
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:46,520
Little ants don't need to win
a Nobel Prize anyway.

141
00:06:46,520 --> 00:06:47,440
The fact that you entered the competition

142
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:48,840
means you're already amazing.

143
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:49,920
You're a big ant.

144
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:51,400
If

145
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:53,600
math doesn't make us happy,

146
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:55,100
we can just change tracks.

147
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:56,280
Taking a step back,

148
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:57,600
persistence is admirable,

149
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,120
but giving up isn't shameful either.

150
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,320
If you know there are tigers
on the mountain,

151
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:02,050
just don't go to that mountain.

152
00:07:10,440 --> 00:07:11,040
By the way,

153
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:13,320
if you're tired of gaming,

154
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:14,640
you can take a few days off.

155
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:16,640
You can go for a walk

156
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:17,720
and enjoy life.

157
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:19,400
It's been raining lately,

158
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:21,160
but it cleared up today.

159
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:23,660
The sky is pinkish too.

160
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:25,050
The clouds are soft too.

161
00:07:25,320 --> 00:07:26,250
Did you see them?

162
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:32,240
I haven't opened my curtains
in a long time.

163
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:34,800
Don't be a gloomy shut-in.

164
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:36,040
Go open the curtains.

165
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:11,640
Look,

166
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:12,770
a sunny puppy cloud.

167
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,200
We've been playing games online

168
00:08:20,200 --> 00:08:21,680
for so long.

169
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:24,560
How about we play an offline game?

170
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:26,210
I'll go buy a jigsaw puzzle.

171
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:27,800
Starting today,

172
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,240
I'll hide its pieces

173
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:31,160
all over the school.

174
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:33,760
You can follow my hints

175
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:35,840
to find them piece by piece.

176
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:37,360
When you find all the pieces

177
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:39,159
and complete the puzzle...

178
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:41,080
I'll give you a reward

179
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,520
and grant you a wish.

180
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:43,460
How about that?

181
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:15,800
Why aren't you answering anyone's calls?

182
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:17,240
How long has it been

183
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:18,840
since you went out after the competition?

184
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:19,680
I know.

185
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,120
You set high standards for yourself

186
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:21,800
and find it hard to accept failure.

187
00:09:21,800 --> 00:09:23,600
I'll hang up if there's nothing else.

188
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,800
I just want to tell you

189
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:27,160
not to coop yourself up in your room.

190
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:29,460
I have no reason to go out.
I'm hanging up.

191
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:40,440
Hello, esteemed user 2847.

192
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,600
Congratulations on being selected

193
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:43,560
for this puzzle treasure hunt.

194
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:45,880
The first puzzle piece
for this event has appeared.

195
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:46,680
The exact location is

196
00:09:46,680 --> 00:09:49,000
under the 28th tree on Stadium Road.

197
00:09:49,280 --> 00:09:51,240
Please go and claim it promptly.

198
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,400
Hello?

199
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:54,330
Is anyone there?

200
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:57,140
Is your phone broken,
or are you taking a shower?

201
00:09:58,400 --> 00:10:00,600
If you're showering, can we video call?

202
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:05,720
This event is only valid
for a limited time.

203
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:08,580
Dear player, please go claim it
as soon as possible.

204
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:22,520
There's nothing on 2847's Moments.

205
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:24,280
It's as mysterious as his game account.

206
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:26,240
How am I supposed to know what he likes?

207
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:27,680
Do you think this trick

208
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:29,000
makes me look childish to him,

209
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:31,000
like some kid's game?

210
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:34,460
The game has already started.

211
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:35,880
Let's just see how it goes.

212
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:37,240
We have options.

213
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,440
It's best if it works.

214
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:40,680
If it doesn't work...

215
00:10:40,760 --> 00:10:41,920
if it doesn't,

216
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:44,840
just say I posted it from your account.

217
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:47,120
Just leave him alone from now on.

218
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:49,320
You...

219
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,760
H-H-He went.

220
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:55,760
He really went.

221
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:57,160
Where? Let me take a look.

222
00:10:58,160 --> 00:10:59,490
Over there, over there.

223
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:01,920
I can't see clearly without my contacts.

224
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:03,360
Dear 2847,

225
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:05,360
congratulations
on completing your first task.

226
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,480
As for the next tasks,

227
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:08,560
Yun Huhu will arrange them for you soon.

228
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:10,440
Once you collect all the puzzle pieces,

229
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:12,680
your wish will come true.

230
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:25,080
The 28th one.

231
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:27,210
It's my favorite tree on this road.

232
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:30,000
Can you feel its strong vitality?

233
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:58,080
Put down your math book.

234
00:11:58,480 --> 00:11:59,960
Check out this comic book instead.
